install_disconnect_guidance_fmt:
Before continuing, please:

1. If it isn't already off, power off your {label}
   (You can use a pin or paperclip to press the reset button if needed)

2. If it is connected, disconnect the USB cable from your {label}

Then click OK and follow the on-screen instructions.

